<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Boulder, CO</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for five premium cabinetry brands — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers across Boulder and the foothills market.</p></div>
