<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Boulder</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Boulder, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. From Mapleton Hill and the Newlands to the foothills neighborhoods, Boulder kitchens blend modern, sustainability-minded design with mountain-modern warmth, and we offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win those projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access cabinetry for clean contemporary Boulder remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint, <a href="/playbook/modern-inset/">inset</a>, and natural wood species for transitional and mountain-modern kitchens.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end foothills homes, with protected territory and strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for ADUs and rental properties.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="boulder-market-opportunity">The Boulder Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Boulder kitchens favor clean, modern design with natural materials — warm woods, matte finishes, and an emphasis on light and sustainability that reflects the city's character. Two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands are common in the area's many craftsman and mid-century remodels, while higher-end foothills projects lean toward <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless</a> construction and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a> kitchens — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Boulder dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

